## Focus 40 — 40 Hz gamma binaural over a pink-noise bed
##
## 180 Hz carrier, 40 Hz beat (gamma). Amplitudes are on the 0-100
## scale; the total per tone-set stays under 100 to avoid clipping.
##
## Headphones required -- binaural beats collapse on speakers.
## Render 30 minutes to MP3:
##   entrain render focus-40-pink.sbg -f mp3 -L 0:30

all-off: -

focus-40: pink/20 180+40/30

0:00:00 focus-40
1:00:00 all-off
